---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import heroImage from '~/assets/images/sctmensa-hero-coast-3000x1500.jpg';

const metadata = {
  title: 'What We Do',
  description: 'Events, meetups, games, and gatherings hosted by Southern Connecticut Mensa.',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden">
    <div class="relative h-[260px] sm:h-[320px] md:h-[420px]">
      <img
        src={heroImage.src}
        alt="Fairfield County coastline"
        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/25"></div>

      <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-end justify-center px-6 pb-10 md:pb-14">
        <h1 class="text-white text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-center drop-shadow">
          What We Do
        </h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 md:py-14">
  <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200">
    Southern Connecticut Mensa hosts a wide range of events, with something for nearly every interest and personality.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200">
    Some gatherings are purely social — dinners, barbecues, bowling nights, and casual get-togethers where the focus is
    simply spending time together and getting to know one another.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200">
    Other events blend social interaction with mind-engaging activities, such as escape rooms, game nights, and local
    trivia competitions.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200">
    We also host intellectually focused events, including speaker presentations and guided discussions. These are often
    led by members or local experts and cover a wide variety of topics — from space, engineering, finance and
    cryptocurrency to sports, gambling, entertainment, and more.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200">
    Members are encouraged to attend the events that interest them and to propose or host new ones if they’re inclined.
    People participate in different ways and for different reasons, but the common thread is curiosity, openness, and
    enjoying the company of like-minded people.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200">
    Spouses, partners, and guests are often welcome at social events, and many members attend together. Each event
    listing clearly notes whether guests are invited, so it’s easy to know what to expect.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200">
    Beyond our local chapter, :contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0} offers events across
    the country. Regional Gatherings are held in cities nationwide, ranging from small and informal to large, multi-day
    events. The Annual Gathering brings together more than 2,500 members each year for speakers, games, and social
    events, while Mind Games gathers hundreds of tabletop strategy gamers for a weekend of judging the best new games of
    the year. These events rotate to a new U.S. city annually, and many members choose to explore the surrounding area
    before or after attending.
  </p>

  <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-200">
    For those who can’t travel — or simply prefer to stay closer to home — there are also many ways to connect remotely.
    Online discussion groups, interest-based Facebook groups, virtual game sessions, Zoom book clubs, and remote
    speakers make it easy to stay involved from anywhere.
  </p>
</section>

</Layout>
